WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.203
Welcome to Module 6 of Global Secure
Access as the Identity-Aware Network:

2
00:00:05.203 --> 00:00:08.075
rings, rollback and the evidence package.

3
00:00:08.075 --> 00:00:11.450
Modules 1 to 5 built
every piece for a pilot.

4
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:15.687
This module makes it a migration, and
then hands an assessor the evidence.

5
00:00:15.687 --> 00:00:20.634
It covers Steps 11 and 12 of the Global
Secure Access implementation guide,

6
00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:24.703
with its RACI, evidence catalog,
metrics, dangers and rollback,

7
00:00:24.703 --> 00:00:29.950
and takes about forty minutes, plus a lab
that rolls your whole test tenant back.
